// Example Syncthing ignore patterns for the shared root. Copy to <root>/.stignore on every device and adjust.
// The idea: sync the Queue, your docs and the things agents hand each other; keep heavy, generated and
// machine-specific content local. Source code is better moved with git than with file sync.
(?d).DS_Store
(?d)Thumbs.db
(?d)desktop.ini
(?d).*.tmp
.git
.venv
node_modules
__pycache__
*.pyc
// build output and caches
dist
build
.next
target
// per-device settings that hold absolute paths
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees
.mcp.json
// logs
*.log
